          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi! I'm **Muhammadaziz Khabibullaev**, a **Software Engineer** from Tashkent, 🇺🇿 Uzbekistan. I enjoy turning complex problems into simple, clear and scalable solutions.\n\nI build reliable backend systems — stable architecture, clean APIs and solid database design — and the pieces around them: web dashboards, Telegram bots and mobile apps, from database to deploy. The goal is always the same: a product that is **fast, secure and easy to maintain**."
        },
