        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Union Paper imports paper and board by rail and delivers it to clients across Tashkent. Before this project, incoming wagons were tracked by hand in Excel, and deliveries were coordinated by phone.\n\nI designed and built one platform that covers the whole chain: **wagon on the railway → warehouse → truck → client's door**. It is a website for the office, a Telegram bot for uploads and login, and a mobile app for drivers."
